# Environment variable template.
#
# Document the NAMES of the variables this project needs here, with no real
# values. Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill it in locally; `.env*` files
# are git-ignored, this example is not.
#
# Anything prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ is exposed to the browser and is therefore
# public. Never put a secret behind that prefix.
#
# Example shape (replace with the variables this project actually uses):
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
# SOME_SERVICE_API_KEY=
